"""CI minutes per PR head: who paid for the heads of PRs that did not merge in the window, how many pushes each PR
paid full CI for, what ran after a newer head was pushed, and spent vs needed (the jobs a head's changed paths
can affect).

Attribution is ci140-class-minutes's (same feed, fleet, required-checks dump, mirror, meter divisor) with two more
namers: a branch names the PR the GraphQL list (--prs) shows on it (created before the run), and a row with no
sha takes the head its PR had when the run was created (the head sequence per PR is the required-checks dump's
heads by seen_at plus every feed sha by its first run's creation; a run is created seconds after its push).

  1. fate: every PR-segment GitHub row and PR fleet job, by its PR's fate (merged in the window, merged after it,
     merged before it, merged into another base, closed unmerged, open draft, open ready, unknown PR, no PR), and
     the not-merged-in-window part by heads with CI per PR, by job, and the top PRs.
  2. spent vs needed: each head's changed paths (git diff --merge-base origin/<base> HEAD, from the mirror) against
     the rule table RULES below (the workflows' own on.pull_request.paths and their changes-job filters, the
     required-checks selection, and for a job with no filter the affected-target rule named in the table). A row
     is needed when its rule matches a changed path or the head has no diff (unknown runs it).
  3. superseded: minutes of rows not cancelled that ran after a newer head of the same PR was pushed.

Inputs (local but --prs; no GitHub calls):
  --feed    GitHub job rows (JSONL, .gz ok): at (= completed), seconds, queue, seg, sha, branch, run, workflow_path, job
  --fleet   controller job rows (JSONL, .gz ok), ci_per_pr.py's FLEET_SCHEMA_FIELDS
  --rc      /v1/required-checks JSON ({"heads": [{pr, head, base, seen_at, ...}]})
  --prs     {number: {number, state, isDraft, mergedAt, closedAt, createdAt, headRefName, baseRefName}} (GraphQL
            repository.pullRequests ordered by UPDATED_AT down to before --since)
  --mirror  a cmux clone with origin/feat-cmux-next, origin/main and the PR heads (trees only: blob-less is fine)

Run: scripts/measure/ci140-head-minutes --feed recs.jsonl.gz --fleet fleet.jsonl.gz --rc rc.json --prs prs.json \
       --mirror ~/Projects/.wt-mirrors/manaflow-ai/cmux.git --since 2026-11-26T10:00:00Z --until 2026-11-27T10:00:00Z
"""
